{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-4-1","title":"Psalms 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David prays for audience. 2 He reproves and exhorts his enemies. 6 Man's happiness is in God's favour.</p>\n<p>(Title.) chief Musician. or, overseer. 22:1; 42:1; 45:1; *titles 1Ch 25:1-6 Neginoth. 6:1; 67:1; 76:1; *titles Hab 3:19; *marg: O. 11:7; 24:5; 41:12; Isa 45:24; Jer 23:6; 1Co 1:30; 2Co 5:20,21 thou. 18:18,19; 31:8; 40:1-3; 116:6,16; 1Sa 17:37; 19:11,12; 23:26-28 Job 36:16; 2Co 1:8,10 have mercy upon me. or, be gracious unto me. 56:1; 57:1; 86:3-5; 119:75-77,132; 143:2; Ex 34:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-2","title":"Psalms 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>O. 57:4; 58:1; Ec 8:11; 9:3 how. 72:2; Ex 10:3; Nu 14:11; Pr 1:22 my glory. 3:3; 14:6; 106:20; Isa 20:5; 45:17; Jer 2:11; Ho 4:7; 1Co 1:31 love. 2:1; 1Sa 12:21; Isa 59:4; Jer 2:5; Jon 2:8 leasing. 5:6; 58:3; 63:11; Jer 9:3; Eph 4:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-3","title":"Psalms 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>that the. Ex 33:16; Eph 2:10; 2Th 2:13,14; 2Ti 2:19; 1Pe 2:9; 2Pe 2:9 for. Tit 2:14 the Lord. 34:15; 55:16,17; 56:9; 91:14,15; Joh 15:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-4","title":"Psalms 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Stand. 2:11; 33:8; 119:161; Jer 5:22 sin. Job 28:28; Pr 3:7; 16:6,17; Eph 4:26 commune. 63:6; 77:6; 2Co 13:5 be still. 46:10; Hab 2:20 Selah. 3:2,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-5","title":"Psalms 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Offer. 50:14; 51:19; De 33:19; 2Sa 15:12; Isa 1:11-18; 61:8; Mal 1:8,11-14 Mt 5:23,23; Heb 13:15,16 put. 2:12; 26:1; 37:3; 62:8; 84:11,12; Isa 26:3,4; 50:10; 1Pe 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-6","title":"Psalms 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>many. 39:6; 49:16-20; Ec 2:3-26; Isa 55:2; Lu 12:19; 16:19; Jas 4:13 Jas 5:1-5 lift. 21:6; 42:5; 44:3; 67:1; 80:1-3,7,19; 89:15; 119:135; Nu 6:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-7","title":"Psalms 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>put. 37:4; 43:4; 63:2-5; 92:4; So 1:4; 1Pe 1:8 the time. Jud 9:27 Isa 9:3; Jer 48:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-4-8","title":"Psalms 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I will. 3:5; 16:8; Job 11:18,19; Pr 3:24; 1Th 4:13,14; 5:10; Re 14:13 for. Le 25:18,19; 26:5; De 12:10; 33:27-29; Eze 34:25; Ho 2:18 Ro 8:35-39</p>"}]}